1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:03,070
Plug ka ek pin baaki do se mota aur lamba kyun hai?

2
00:00:03,090 --> 00:00:05,000
Mtlb ye akela gym jaata hai kya?

3
00:00:05,020 --> 00:00:07,250
Log sochte hain ye zyada bijli leta hai.

4
00:00:07,270 --> 00:00:09,580
Ulta, isme normally current behta hi nahi.

5
00:00:09,600 --> 00:00:11,180
Ye hai earth pin.

6
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:14,230
Baaki do — live aur neutral — bijli laate aur le jaate hain.

7
00:00:14,250 --> 00:00:16,920
Earth pin ka kaam sirf ek hai — aapki jaan bachana.

8
00:00:16,940 --> 00:00:20,650
Socho, washing machine ki body mein current aa jaaye... aur aap use chhoo lo!

9
00:00:20,670 --> 00:00:23,780
Earth pin us current ko aapki jagah zameen mein bhej deta hai.

10
00:00:23,800 --> 00:00:26,790
Ab lamba kyun? Taaki plug lagao toh earth sabse pehle lage,

11
00:00:26,810 --> 00:00:28,920
aur nikalo toh sabse baad mein nikle.

12
00:00:28,940 --> 00:00:33,210
Aur mota kyun? Taaki iski pehchan alag se ho aur galti se bhi plug me kahi aur na lag jaye.

13
00:00:33,230 --> 00:00:35,700
Aapke ghar mein kaun hai jo ye nahi janta tha?

14
00:00:35,720 --> 00:00:38,550
Share karo use sath! Aur subscribe karo Whysplained ko!
